#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, combo_ACTION_OPEN_MISMATCH_CMYK)
#: rc.cpp:132
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"<li><b>Preserve Numbers:</b> Allow the source CMYK profile to be kept and "
"unchanged from the destination.</li>\n"
"<li><b>Automatically Convert:</b> Convert the source CMYK profile to its "
"destination.</li>\n"
"<li><b>Prompt User:</b> Allow the user to choose which method to use.</li>\n"
"</ul>"
